(4031348, 577180, 65858, '<td valign="top">Wow, very cool!  This image demands attention.  Great work!<br/> <br/>Lovely contrast in the hair, engaging expression, fascinating decorations.  10+fav!</td>', 'Wow, very cool!  This image demands attention.  Great work! Lovely contrast in the hair, engaging expression, fascinating decorations.  10+fav!', '2007-08-27 01:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4031351, 577771, 68599, '<td valign="top">Elsapo? it must be.</td>', 'Elsapo? it must be.', '2007-08-27 01:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4031354, 576092, 34938, '<td valign="top">Judy, I am a huge Neil Diamond fan...did you know Hot August Night was recorded live at the Greek Theatre Los Angeles 35 years ago (August 24, 1972). How life flies by. This is a great honest image, fantastic as a square crop...the title suits of course. I would have liked a little more contrast, but I am a contrast hog...great work here...catchlights in the eyes are great 9</td>', 'Judy, I am a huge Neil Diamond fan...did you know Hot August Night was recorded live at the Greek Theatre Los Angeles 35 years ago (August 24, 1972). How life flies by. This is a great honest image, fantastic as a square crop...the title suits of course. I would have liked a little more contrast, but I am a contrast hog...great work here...catchlights in the eyes are great 9', '2007-08-27 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
