(4034160, 577639, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had this beeen more in focus around the nose, I would have given you a 10. I like th eyes and the color. Hopefully you used a zoom lens (or the bear just had its lunch and wasn''t hungry) Lol</td>', 'Had this beeen more in focus around the nose, I would have given you a 10. I like th eyes and the color. Hopefully you used a zoom lens (or the bear just had its lunch and wasn''t hungry) Lol', '2007-08-27 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034165, 577580, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, I can feel the texture of the horse. I like the soft background too - it adds to the overall feel of your photo. Well done and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very sweet, I can feel the texture of the horse. I like the soft background too - it adds to the overall feel of your photo. Well done and good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-27 22:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034167, 576199, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the leaf and the water droplets add interest. Well done and best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the texture of the leaf and the water droplets add interest. Well done and best of luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-27 22:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034171, 577618, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wonderful fill the frame action shot! Good lighting, color and composition. Can''t see how this could be any better. 10</td>', 'Wonderful fill the frame action shot! Good lighting, color and composition. Can''t see how this could be any better. 10', '2007-08-27 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034174, 577316, 76430, '<td valign="top">I can''t read the card, she has a funny look on her face and it doesn''t fill the frame.  I''m afraid I can''t rate this very high.</td>', 'I can''t read the card, she has a funny look on her face and it doesn''t fill the frame.  I''m afraid I can''t rate this very high.', '2007-08-27 22:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034175, 577653, 41675, '<td valign="top">Seems a little....hazy to me. I like the tongue hanging out and the appranet softness of the fur. Good fill the frame entry.</td>', 'Seems a little....hazy to me. I like the tongue hanging out and the appranet softness of the fur. Good fill the frame entry.', '2007-08-27 22:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034180, 577420, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - cats are so demanding, aren''t they? I like the eyes - very nicely done. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lol - cats are so demanding, aren''t they? I like the eyes - very nicely done. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-27 22:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034185, 577709, 41675, '<td valign="top">Busy, but I like the patterns, shapes and forms. Neat shadows.</td>', 'Busy, but I like the patterns, shapes and forms. Neat shadows.', '2007-08-27 22:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034187, 577567, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast. Had you cropped in even tighter to just the flower and less of the brown siding, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Nice color contrast. Had you cropped in even tighter to just the flower and less of the brown siding, I would have scored it higher.', '2007-08-27 22:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034189, 576590, 76430, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to figure out there was someone wearing that fabulous necklace.  Very sharp and good selective desat.</td>', 'It took me a minute to figure out there was someone wearing that fabulous necklace.  Very sharp and good selective desat.', '2007-08-27 22:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034191, 577396, 41675, '<td valign="top">The flash is a bit bright, but I like the color contrasts, black background and idea.</td>', 'The flash is a bit bright, but I like the color contrasts, black background and idea.', '2007-08-27 22:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034194, 577320, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the roof and the vertical lines of the building. You have a good visual eye for patterns.</td>', 'I like the roof and the vertical lines of the building. You have a good visual eye for patterns.', '2007-08-27 22:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034199, 576197, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice exterior building image. I like the texture of the walls. I wonder how this would look if cropped down tight to the first floor of windows?</td>', 'Nice exterior building image. I like the texture of the walls. I wonder how this would look if cropped down tight to the first floor of windows?', '2007-08-27 22:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034202, 576874, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the lighting and composition.</td>', 'Nice image. I like the lighting and composition.', '2007-08-27 22:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034205, 576347, 41675, '<td valign="top">The center of the flower itself seems over processed or too dark. I like the composition and idea though.</td>', 'The center of the flower itself seems over processed or too dark. I like the composition and idea though.', '2007-08-27 22:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034209, 577025, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice fill the frame. My favorite parts are the shadows.</td>', 'Nice fill the frame. My favorite parts are the shadows.', '2007-08-27 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034212, 577044, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good fill the frame entry. I like it. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good fill the frame entry. I like it. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-27 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034213, 576104, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the water droplets - adds a lot of interest to your photo.</td>', 'Nice image. I like the water droplets - adds a lot of interest to your photo.', '2007-08-27 22:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034216, 576541, 41675, '<td valign="top">I loike the bright color contrassts. I would have cropped out that bit of black on the right hand side. It''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'I loike the bright color contrassts. I would have cropped out that bit of black on the right hand side. It''s a bit distracting.', '2007-08-27 22:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034217, 577571, 36981, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Good luck.</td>', 'Love it!  Good luck.', '2007-08-27 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034233, 575731, 66267, '<td valign="top">interesting...</td>', 'interesting...', '2007-08-27 22:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034335, 577002, 75328, '<td valign="top">i dig that reflection in the eyes</td>', 'i dig that reflection in the eyes', '2007-08-27 23:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034347, 577400, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not my favorite crop - I''d rather see one of the headlights (whole or mostly so) or none of the headlights on either side. To be really picky, your crop is not exactly symmetrical - there is more of the headlight on the left (car''s right) than there is on the other side or level. But, I love old cars. The grille on this one make an especially pleasing pattern, and your highlights in the curves are nice with no obvious trace of the photographer in any reflections. Not a particularly colorful shot, but the tan is pleasing, and nicely accented with the chrome and black. The Packard was a top-of-the-line luxury car for its day, and this shot does it credit. 9</td>', 'Not my favorite crop - I''d rather see one of the headlights (whole or mostly so) or none of the headlights on either side. To be really picky, your crop is not exactly symmetrical - there is more of the headlight on the left (car''s right) than there is on the other side or level. But, I love old cars. The grille on this one make an especially pleasing pattern, and your highlights in the curves are nice with no obvious trace of the photographer in any reflections. Not a particularly colorful shot, but the tan is pleasing, and nicely accented with the chrome and black. The Packard was a top-of-the-line luxury car for its day, and this shot does it credit. 9', '2007-08-27 23:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034354, 577254, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice look back at nostalgia technology. I like the dial. Phone itself seems a little on the blue side, rather than black.</td>', 'Nice look back at nostalgia technology. I like the dial. Phone itself seems a little on the blue side, rather than black.', '2007-08-27 23:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034357, 577400, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice fill the frame. I like the lines. Being an old car, I wonder how this would look in black and white?</td>', 'Nice fill the frame. I like the lines. Being an old car, I wonder how this would look in black and white?', '2007-08-27 23:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034358, 577782, 41675, '<td valign="top">For a quick moment, it looked real, then I noticed the background. With a bit more contrast, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'For a quick moment, it looked real, then I noticed the background. With a bit more contrast, I would have scored it higher.', '2007-08-27 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034360, 577726, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. Great color contrast, composition and lighting. This should be top three if not number one. 10</td>', 'Very cool image. Great color contrast, composition and lighting. This should be top three if not number one. 10', '2007-08-27 23:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034362, 577607, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - Your photo makes me smile. Turtles are so cool looking. Its like he''s looking right at me. Good image.</td>', 'Lol - Your photo makes me smile. Turtles are so cool looking. Its like he''s looking right at me. Good image.', '2007-08-27 23:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034364, 577685, 37930, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective but it''s very grainy and not well lit. Also appears to be slight motion blur or camera shake which in this case doesn''t add to the image but detracts from it.</td>', 'Neat perspective but it''s very grainy and not well lit. Also appears to be slight motion blur or camera shake which in this case doesn''t add to the image but detracts from it.', '2007-08-27 23:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034366, 577136, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like bugs, but I won''t hold that against this really good image. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really don''t like bugs, but I won''t hold that against this really good image. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-27 23:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034369, 576155, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aside from appearing slightly over sharpened - excellent image. I like the eyes and lighting.</td>', 'Aside from appearing slightly over sharpened - excellent image. I like the eyes and lighting.', '2007-08-27 23:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034371, 577575, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, interesting take on the challenge - I like it. I think with just a hint more light or color contrast I would have scored it higher. Good composition of elements.</td>', 'Ahhh, interesting take on the challenge - I like it. I think with just a hint more light or color contrast I would have scored it higher. Good composition of elements.', '2007-08-27 23:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034374, 577729, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice fill the frame entry. Pretty flower.</td>', 'Nice fill the frame entry. Pretty flower.', '2007-08-27 23:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034375, 577666, 82022, '<td valign="top">The flat lighting combined with the straight on angle take a lot away from this image. I think that with a different angle and better lighting it would be a much more interesting photo.</td>', 'The flat lighting combined with the straight on angle take a lot away from this image. I think that with a different angle and better lighting it would be a much more interesting photo.', '2007-08-27 23:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034378, 577418, 41675, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh, but I like your image. A good fill the frame entry.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh, but I like your image. A good fill the frame entry.', '2007-08-27 23:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034379, 577775, 77196, '<td valign="top">Your alignment of the half lines is what makes this shot. There is enough there to make it feel like a pattern, and enough to break the pattern to make it unpredictable.</td>', 'Your alignment of the half lines is what makes this shot. There is enough there to make it feel like a pattern, and enough to break the pattern to make it unpredictable.', '2007-08-27 23:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034382, 577689, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat things. I like the textures and black background. Maybe a tad over sharpened, but fun to look at.</td>', 'Neat things. I like the textures and black background. Maybe a tad over sharpened, but fun to look at.', '2007-08-27 23:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034383, 577610, 82022, '<td valign="top">Severe gingivitis...</td>', 'Severe gingivitis...', '2007-08-27 23:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034387, 577753, 41675, '<td valign="top">A little more focus on the ball and I would have scored it higher. Good composition and natural lighting.</td>', 'A little more focus on the ball and I would have scored it higher. Good composition and natural lighting.', '2007-08-27 23:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034389, 577249, 41675, '<td valign="top">With a bit more focus, I would have scored it better. I like the blurred background and lighting.</td>', 'With a bit more focus, I would have scored it better. I like the blurred background and lighting.', '2007-08-27 23:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034390, 577489, 41675, '<td valign="top">My eyes water just looking at its eye - ouchie! Poor thing. It probably got poked by a zoom lens - lol. I like the tongue.</td>', 'My eyes water just looking at its eye - ouchie! Poor thing. It probably got poked by a zoom lens - lol. I like the tongue.', '2007-08-27 23:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034394, 575978, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - how funny! Nasty looking teeth, but neat image. Now this is a fill the frame without a doubt! I love the light and its so sharp. I hope you get a ribbon! 10</td>', 'Lol - how funny! Nasty looking teeth, but neat image. Now this is a fill the frame without a doubt! I love the light and its so sharp. I hope you get a ribbon! 10', '2007-08-27 23:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034396, 576244, 77196, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is too shallow. The mouth is OOF, and detracts a lot IMO. Chin OOF would be OK.</td>', 'Depth of field is too shallow. The mouth is OOF, and detracts a lot IMO. Chin OOF would be OK.', '2007-08-27 23:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034397, 577686, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat photo. I like lookint at the textures. Not quite sure what it is, but I like it.</td>', 'Neat photo. I like lookint at the textures. Not quite sure what it is, but I like it.', '2007-08-27 23:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034399, 577544, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good closeup with textures and lighting.</td>', 'Good closeup with textures and lighting.', '2007-08-27 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034405, 577730, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - I had thought of something similar but couldn''t figure out how to pull it off. Kudos!! I love it! Good luck in the challenge. I look forward to seeing what other comments you receive.</td>', 'Lol - I had thought of something similar but couldn''t figure out how to pull it off. Kudos!! I love it! Good luck in the challenge. I look forward to seeing what other comments you receive.', '2007-08-27 23:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034408, 577474, 41675, '<td valign="top">You''ve definitely filled the frame - and I like that part. The yellow seems a bit over saturated, but I like the color contrast between that and the petals.</td>', 'You''ve definitely filled the frame - and I like that part. The yellow seems a bit over saturated, but I like the color contrast between that and the petals.', '2007-08-27 23:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034412, 575169, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I wonder if this will get dq''d for being three images? With the black bars it almost looks like he''s in prison - poor little guy.</td>', 'Hmmm, I wonder if this will get dq''d for being three images? With the black bars it almost looks like he''s in prison - poor little guy.', '2007-08-27 23:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
