(4034667, 577052, 76430, '<td valign="top">Those beautiful blue eyes really draw me in.  Really nice picture and it meets the challenge well.  What is the flower shaped reflection?</td>', 'Those beautiful blue eyes really draw me in.  Really nice picture and it meets the challenge well.  What is the flower shaped reflection?', '2007-08-28 01:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
