(4036517, 577659, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a tremendous portrait and unlike some other shots, even some really good shots, this truly benefits from filling the frame. 10<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>I think what I like best about it is that he doesn''t seem like a photographer at all. There''s something so casual about how he has thrust the camera to his face. But casual is not the right word. He seems like an amateur in the very best sense. He is only taking a picture because a picture has presented itself. And once he''s done, he will casually throw the camera to his nervous sidekick and get back to his card game.</td>', 'This is a tremendous portrait and unlike some other shots, even some really good shots, this truly benefits from filling the frame. 10 Posthumous Blue Ribbon:   I think what I like best about it is that he doesn''t seem like a photographer at all. There''s something so casual about how he has thrust the camera to his face. But casual is not the right word. He seems like an amateur in the very best sense. He is only taking a picture because a picture has presented itself. And once he''s done, he will casually throw the camera to his nervous sidekick and get back to his card game.', '2007-08-28 22:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036520, 577499, 7910, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2007-08-28 22:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036522, 577624, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow. Just wow. 10<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>This is like Levi-Strauss meets Mondrian</td>', 'Wow. Just wow. 10 Posthumous Red Ribbon   This is like Levi-Strauss meets Mondrian', '2007-08-28 22:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036523, 576065, 50695, '<td valign="top">Had to give this a 10 for goofiness factor. This gave me as much pleasure as any of the other entries.</td>', 'Had to give this a 10 for goofiness factor. This gave me as much pleasure as any of the other entries.', '2007-08-28 22:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036524, 577721, 7910, '<td valign="top">Soft, simple, nice composition.</td>', 'Soft, simple, nice composition.', '2007-08-28 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036525, 577161, 50695, '<td valign="top">remarkable. I could see this being sold as a poster at an auction. but it would be a painting.</td>', 'remarkable. I could see this being sold as a poster at an auction. but it would be a painting.', '2007-08-28 22:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036527, 577571, 50695, '<td valign="top">amazing portrait. perfect DOF. I''m not sure why this is head and shoulders above shots in a similar vein, but it certainly is.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'amazing portrait. perfect DOF. I''m not sure why this is head and shoulders above shots in a similar vein, but it certainly is. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon: ', '2007-08-28 22:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4036528, 576478, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2007-08-28 22:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
