(4038220, 574419, 73981, '<td valign="top">The front piece is over-exposed, the board is not flat (I''m assuming it''s not actually a board but plastic?), the flash is too strong (Perhaps the onboard flash). The image itself is not very interesting, unless perhaps if you are into chess. I would''ve cropped the upper portion, cleaned the sheet, and made sure all the colors and exposure was in balance.</td>', 'The front piece is over-exposed, the board is not flat (I''m assuming it''s not actually a board but plastic?), the flash is too strong (Perhaps the onboard flash). The image itself is not very interesting, unless perhaps if you are into chess. I would''ve cropped the upper portion, cleaned the sheet, and made sure all the colors and exposure was in balance.', '2007-08-29 11:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4038228, 575601, 73981, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately it''s a bit too dark for my taste. Some shadows/highlights might have helped to bring out the fur a bit more.</td>', 'Unfortunately it''s a bit too dark for my taste. Some shadows/highlights might have helped to bring out the fur a bit more.', '2007-08-29 11:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
