(4039792, 577052, 19786, '<td valign="top">Beautiful face, great expression.  Those eyes look down into your soul.</td>', 'Beautiful face, great expression.  Those eyes look down into your soul.', '2007-08-29 20:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039794, 577418, 19786, '<td valign="top">I would have used the rest of the dial as frame.</td>', 'I would have used the rest of the dial as frame.', '2007-08-29 20:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039796, 577482, 19786, '<td valign="top">Where is the sun?</td>', 'Where is the sun?', '2007-08-29 20:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039799, 577109, 19786, '<td valign="top">Good use of light to bring out the texture.</td>', 'Good use of light to bring out the texture.', '2007-08-29 20:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039803, 577776, 19786, '<td valign="top">Great angle.</td>', 'Great angle.', '2007-08-29 20:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039809, 577660, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you are going for here.  It''s very out of focus.  It appears to be a long exposure with two flashes on the same subject, so maybe you used an incandescent light rather than a strobe, causing the blur, or maybe just minimal lighting with no flash at all?  I haven''t a clue what the title means.  Sorry, I can''t vote this highly.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you are going for here.  It''s very out of focus.  It appears to be a long exposure with two flashes on the same subject, so maybe you used an incandescent light rather than a strobe, causing the blur, or maybe just minimal lighting with no flash at all?  I haven''t a clue what the title means.  Sorry, I can''t vote this highly.', '2007-08-29 21:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039815, 577639, 76430, '<td valign="top">Not a very sharp focus, but if this is truly a bear in the wild that''s understandable!  How did you get so close to get shallow DOF within the face?  The look in his/her eyes seems sad and contemplative.  Points added for bravery!</td>', 'Not a very sharp focus, but if this is truly a bear in the wild that''s understandable!  How did you get so close to get shallow DOF within the face?  The look in his/her eyes seems sad and contemplative.  Points added for bravery!', '2007-08-29 21:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039819, 577781, 19786, '<td valign="top">What beautiful color!</td>', 'What beautiful color!', '2007-08-29 21:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039839, 576566, 19786, '<td valign="top">This one really caught my eye and the more I look at it the more I like it.  The asymetrical layout of the clock face and the color along with the black and white as a frame is outstanding.  The bone man in the corner adds whimsey... Great shot.</td>', 'This one really caught my eye and the more I look at it the more I like it.  The asymetrical layout of the clock face and the color along with the black and white as a frame is outstanding.  The bone man in the corner adds whimsey... Great shot.', '2007-08-29 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039841, 577717, 19786, '<td valign="top">Beauty is everywhere.</td>', 'Beauty is everywhere.', '2007-08-29 21:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039846, 575187, 19786, '<td valign="top">The veil is a perfect frame for those incredible eyes.</td>', 'The veil is a perfect frame for those incredible eyes.', '2007-08-29 21:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039849, 576375, 19786, '<td valign="top">Well framed and great color.</td>', 'Well framed and great color.', '2007-08-29 21:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039864, 575861, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a little more DOF to see the front side of the apple in focus as well as the middle that already is in focus.</td>', 'I''d like to see a little more DOF to see the front side of the apple in focus as well as the middle that already is in focus.', '2007-08-29 21:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039865, 576065, 19786, '<td valign="top">Fantastic imagination!</td>', 'Fantastic imagination!', '2007-08-29 21:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039867, 577159, 76430, '<td valign="top">Either some wild lighting or some extensive PP work.  Nice macro portrayal of a coin.  It doesn''t look as sharp as I''d like to see it.</td>', 'Either some wild lighting or some extensive PP work.  Nice macro portrayal of a coin.  It doesn''t look as sharp as I''d like to see it.', '2007-08-29 21:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039884, 577444, 76430, '<td valign="top">Your subject is far from filling the frame.  A reflector, being closer up, and waiting for a really good expression would have done wonders here.</td>', 'Your subject is far from filling the frame.  A reflector, being closer up, and waiting for a really good expression would have done wonders here.', '2007-08-29 21:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4039896, 577775, 76430, '<td valign="top">Wow, you went to a lot of work placing all of the pills with the lines radiating from the bright pill without the line.  Interesting abstract.  Good lighting and use of thirds.</td>', 'Wow, you went to a lot of work placing all of the pills with the lines radiating from the bright pill without the line.  Interesting abstract.  Good lighting and use of thirds.', '2007-08-29 21:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
