(4042301, 577582, 16230, '<td valign="top">Now that is an interesting look. Did you do it with lighting (perhaps painting with light), or with post-processing? Either way, it''s a nifty image.</td>', 'Now that is an interesting look. Did you do it with lighting (perhaps painting with light), or with post-processing? Either way, it''s a nifty image.', '2007-08-30 18:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
