(4044816, 577316, 42254, '<td valign="top">A really cute expression, but I think the card she is holding distracts from what should be the center of attention--her face. Of course, you may not have gotten the same expression without here connection to this card.</td>', 'A really cute expression, but I think the card she is holding distracts from what should be the center of attention--her face. Of course, you may not have gotten the same expression without here connection to this card.', '2007-08-31 21:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
