(4044854, 577515, 42254, '<td valign="top">Nice angle on dog, but seems out of focus...hard to catch much detail.</td>', 'Nice angle on dog, but seems out of focus...hard to catch much detail.', '2007-08-31 22:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044858, 577730, 42254, '<td valign="top">Clever...just wish you didn''t have the white streaks--thought it was a candle at first glance.</td>', 'Clever...just wish you didn''t have the white streaks--thought it was a candle at first glance.', '2007-08-31 22:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044861, 576888, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot--soft yet sharp, with lovely textures.</td>', 'Beautiful shot--soft yet sharp, with lovely textures.', '2007-08-31 22:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044868, 576704, 19978, '<td valign="top">A horse, right? Definitely meets the challenge. I''m a fan of the colors too, deep brown appeals to me. I love the textures and detail present. I feel like the eye would have been better served had the reflection been minimized somehow, perhaps with just a catchlight. Given the way it looks, I''m pretty sure you worked hard to get the level horizon in the reflection just right. It''s a great image technically, but doesn''t really resonate with me on an emotional level. A solid 6.</td>', 'A horse, right? Definitely meets the challenge. I''m a fan of the colors too, deep brown appeals to me. I love the textures and detail present. I feel like the eye would have been better served had the reflection been minimized somehow, perhaps with just a catchlight. Given the way it looks, I''m pretty sure you worked hard to get the level horizon in the reflection just right. It''s a great image technically, but doesn''t really resonate with me on an emotional level. A solid 6.', '2007-08-31 22:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044873, 577775, 42254, '<td valign="top">I like the way you arranged all the cut marks to lead the eye to the one pill...makes a much more interesting pattern than a random group.</td>', 'I like the way you arranged all the cut marks to lead the eye to the one pill...makes a much more interesting pattern than a random group.', '2007-08-31 22:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044876, 577030, 42254, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2007-08-31 22:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044880, 577582, 42254, '<td valign="top">Wow...not just another flower closeup.  It''s more like a painting. Yes, I can almost smell it!<br/> <br/>Waiting to see how you took this shot and processed it.</td>', 'Wow...not just another flower closeup.  It''s more like a painting. Yes, I can almost smell it! Waiting to see how you took this shot and processed it.', '2007-08-31 22:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044900, 577772, 42254, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and dark-light contrast.</td>', 'Nice composition and dark-light contrast.', '2007-08-31 22:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044902, 577659, 42254, '<td valign="top">Humorous with cigar &amp; smashed nose--good shot, as well.</td>', 'Humorous with cigar & smashed nose--good shot, as well.', '2007-08-31 22:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044905, 576690, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Shot of the eyes...nice composition angle.</td>', 'Beautiful Shot of the eyes...nice composition angle.', '2007-08-31 22:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044908, 577085, 42254, '<td valign="top">Wow!  He grabs ya!  Beautiful color as well.</td>', 'Wow!  He grabs ya!  Beautiful color as well.', '2007-08-31 22:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044922, 577660, 42254, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to understand this.  The Janus head is usually two-faced in opposite directions, but I suppose that isn''t essential.  Not sure of the significance of holding the tongue.  Don''t know how to rate it; with everything out of focus--not just the alter-ego, it isn''t very appealing. Will give you credit for trying to communicate a complex idea in your photography...and you did fill the frame!</td>', 'I''m trying to understand this.  The Janus head is usually two-faced in opposite directions, but I suppose that isn''t essential.  Not sure of the significance of holding the tongue.  Don''t know how to rate it; with everything out of focus--not just the alter-ego, it isn''t very appealing. Will give you credit for trying to communicate a complex idea in your photography...and you did fill the frame!', '2007-08-31 22:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4044923, 577404, 42254, '<td valign="top">Intense!</td>', 'Intense!', '2007-08-31 22:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
