(4050745, 577781, 45631, '<td valign="top">The colors are lovely.  Great shot.</td>', 'The colors are lovely.  Great shot.', '2007-09-02 17:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050791, 577243, 68546, '<td valign="top">This has the potential to be a really nice portrait. I think the lighting could use a bit more balance from the right to soften the shadow from the nose and get more of a catchlight in the eye. This is relatively minor though and I think the main problem I have with this is the over processing. Too much blur of neat image on the skin gives it a very plastic look and doesn''t match the still sharp eyes and mouth. Had this been toned down I think this would be very good.</td>', 'This has the potential to be a really nice portrait. I think the lighting could use a bit more balance from the right to soften the shadow from the nose and get more of a catchlight in the eye. This is relatively minor though and I think the main problem I have with this is the over processing. Too much blur of neat image on the skin gives it a very plastic look and doesn''t match the still sharp eyes and mouth. Had this been toned down I think this would be very good.', '2007-09-02 18:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050817, 576566, 68546, '<td valign="top">Prague! Nice shot</td>', 'Prague! Nice shot', '2007-09-02 18:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050820, 577730, 62895, '<td valign="top">Haha, very clever.</td>', 'Haha, very clever.', '2007-09-02 18:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050827, 577644, 67697, '<td valign="top">Earl had a long night of drinking and when he got home, he thought he''d get something to eat before going to bed.  He poked around in the refrigerator and found some bread and butter.  He figured that his wife must have had a fancy party that day because the butter had a crazy shape and tasted funny too.  The next morning, much to his wife''s dismay, Earl was found dead at the kitchen table, the victim of an allergic reaction to the pesticide still left on the yellow rose.  <br/> <br/>A very beautiful pic.  The lighting is awesome and I love the droplets of water on the flower.  Beatiful catch of the details on the petal and personally, I think it does an incredibly good job of filling the frame!</td>', 'Earl had a long night of drinking and when he got home, he thought he''d get something to eat before going to bed.  He poked around in the refrigerator and found some bread and butter.  He figured that his wife must have had a fancy party that day because the butter had a crazy shape and tasted funny too.  The next morning, much to his wife''s dismay, Earl was found dead at the kitchen table, the victim of an allergic reaction to the pesticide still left on the yellow rose.   A very beautiful pic.  The lighting is awesome and I love the droplets of water on the flower.  Beatiful catch of the details on the petal and personally, I think it does an incredibly good job of filling the frame!', '2007-09-02 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050993, 577320, 66952, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clean. The lighting and shadows are nice.</td>', 'Crisp and clean. The lighting and shadows are nice.', '2007-09-02 20:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050994, 577157, 66952, '<td valign="top">Very graphic. I keep getting drawn back to this one, probably because it''s so different from most of the others. Nice.</td>', 'Very graphic. I keep getting drawn back to this one, probably because it''s so different from most of the others. Nice.', '2007-09-02 20:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
