(4051564, 577180, 70000, '<td valign="top">all the tatoos are a bit much for me, it looks like a 4 year old kind of attacked her face. haha your lighting is is FABULOUS and i love her eyes and expression, if it were me i would loose all the tatoos besides the flowers with the swirlies under her eyes and the butterfly in the center of her forhead. i also like the texture in her hair, it balances the sharpness in her eyes with the softness in the rest of the pciture. the border doesn''t really seem necessary either in my opinion. I don''t know if it is just my monitor but it has a blueish tint to it which i also think is cool</td>', 'all the tatoos are a bit much for me, it looks like a 4 year old kind of attacked her face. haha your lighting is is FABULOUS and i love her eyes and expression, if it were me i would loose all the tatoos besides the flowers with the swirlies under her eyes and the butterfly in the center of her forhead. i also like the texture in her hair, it balances the sharpness in her eyes with the softness in the rest of the pciture. the border doesn''t really seem necessary either in my opinion. I don''t know if it is just my monitor but it has a blueish tint to it which i also think is cool', '2007-09-03 00:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
