(4052638, 576951, 74015, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it was underrated but my afterthought is that for something like this, I would have been better with something that can provoke some kind of emotion in the viewer.  I think the idea for my image was good but against close-up of beautiful eyes and faces, it didn''t stand a chance...<br/> <br/>PS: thanks for your nice comment Bob...  I''ll keep working!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-03 08:30:13.</i></td>', 'I don''t know if it was underrated but my afterthought is that for something like this, I would have been better with something that can provoke some kind of emotion in the viewer.  I think the idea for my image was good but against close-up of beautiful eyes and faces, it didn''t stand a chance... PS: thanks for your nice comment Bob...  I''ll keep working!', '2007-09-03 09:29:38.000000', '2007-09-03 09:30:13.000000', 0),
