(4055316, 577792, 66384, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the compliment above -- it is a nice surprises. <br/> <br/>I don''t agree that this is over exposed. I really like the light and exposure. The effect you achieved is almost 3-D. My only regret about this shot is that I can''t see to the bottom of those stamen or pistils (I don''t know flower parts). My eye keeps going to the bottom of the shot and trying to peek in behind the lower edge of the frame.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-04 01:09:07.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the compliment above -- it is a nice surprises.  I don''t agree that this is over exposed. I really like the light and exposure. The effect you achieved is almost 3-D. My only regret about this shot is that I can''t see to the bottom of those stamen or pistils (I don''t know flower parts). My eye keeps going to the bottom of the shot and trying to peek in behind the lower edge of the frame.', '2007-09-04 02:07:06.000000', '2007-09-04 02:09:07.000000', 0),
