(4057601, 577180, 48697, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic shot! regardless of where it placed in the challenge as a photo it is a perfect 10.  The lighting is great and the eyes are stunning!  Glad to hear that you got something more important out of the shot and that is some bonding time with your daughter.</td>', 'What a fantastic shot! regardless of where it placed in the challenge as a photo it is a perfect 10.  The lighting is great and the eyes are stunning!  Glad to hear that you got something more important out of the shot and that is some bonding time with your daughter.', '2007-09-04 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4057655, 577243, 43073, '<td valign="top">I''ve spent a bit of time looking at these two shots; I really like what you''ve done with the tones and the shades, and I think the crop is spot on (it helped to have the original to judge that). You do get a feeling that this is a confident young woman; that comes through pretty strongly in the capture. Her eyes are bright, her smile honest (and, I must say, untroubled). You''ve thought about the technicals of processing, but don''t miss what you''ve captured and what''s still come through.</td>', 'I''ve spent a bit of time looking at these two shots; I really like what you''ve done with the tones and the shades, and I think the crop is spot on (it helped to have the original to judge that). You do get a feeling that this is a confident young woman; that comes through pretty strongly in the capture. Her eyes are bright, her smile honest (and, I must say, untroubled). You''ve thought about the technicals of processing, but don''t miss what you''ve captured and what''s still come through.', '2007-09-04 17:54:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4057662, 577024, 43073, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. Delightful colors, crisply and cleanly presented, with a  wonderful use of the web to fill the frame but still allow you to have a strong subject. Excellent!</td>', 'Awesome capture. Delightful colors, crisply and cleanly presented, with a  wonderful use of the web to fill the frame but still allow you to have a strong subject. Excellent!', '2007-09-04 17:56:21.000000', NULL, 0),
