(4139885, 577723, 65858, '<td valign="top">Hey Michelle,<br/> <br/>The light in the pavilion is roughly equivalent to an overcast day, because the roof is basically white plastic.  So there was a lot of ambient light.  Being an advanced editing challenge, I also dodged the butterfly a bit to make it stand out, though not a lot was needed.</td>', 'Hey Michelle, The light in the pavilion is roughly equivalent to an overcast day, because the roof is basically white plastic.  So there was a lot of ambient light.  Being an advanced editing challenge, I also dodged the butterfly a bit to make it stand out, though not a lot was needed.', '2007-10-04 01:25:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4143165, 575145, 30982, '<td valign="top">I envy your ability to get such great focus on self-portrait shots.  This one is better than what you use as your face on IM - can you change to this one?  :-)</td>', 'I envy your ability to get such great focus on self-portrait shots.  This one is better than what you use as your face on IM - can you change to this one?  :-)', '2007-10-05 02:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
