(4437091, 576573, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot.  I would suspect it didn''t score as well as you''d have liked due to the challenge (might not have "filled the frame" in voter''s eyes) or perhaps the editing on the eyes.  I sometimes see this type of editing as "overdone" but in this portrait, it matches your overall processing very well.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot.  I would suspect it didn''t score as well as you''d have liked due to the challenge (might not have "filled the frame" in voter''s eyes) or perhaps the editing on the eyes.  I sometimes see this type of editing as "overdone" but in this portrait, it matches your overall processing very well.', '2008-01-29 16:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
