(4733001, 577584, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent. This is a beautiful shot. Your son has gorgeous, expressive eyes. He''s going to break a lot of hearts one of these days.<br/>I did a portrait shot of my step-daughter recently and got a comment from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LevT</a> saying he would have taken more off the top. After holding my hand over the top of the picture I saw he was right. The shot was more balanced. I got this feeling when I held my hand over the top of your image. Hope you don''t mind me telling you this, I''m certainly no expert.<br/>Cheers,<br/>Irene<br/>Edited for spelling.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-29 14:06:31.</i></td>', 'Excellent. This is a beautiful shot. Your son has gorgeous, expressive eyes. He''s going to break a lot of hearts one of these days.I did a portrait shot of my step-daughter recently and got a comment from  LevT saying he would have taken more off the top. After holding my hand over the top of the picture I saw he was right. The shot was more balanced. I got this feeling when I held my hand over the top of your image. Hope you don''t mind me telling you this, I''m certainly no expert.Cheers,IreneEdited for spelling.', '2008-05-29 15:05:42.000000', '2008-05-29 15:06:31.000000', 0),
